# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 230-245
section Mining 230-245

step Mithril & Dark Iron (230-245)
  tip Walk the loop and mine every Gold (155, green), Mithril (175, green), Dark Iron (230, orange), Truesilver (230, orange) node on the way until Mining 245. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Dark Iron Ore smelts only at the Black Forge in Blackrock Depths (8 ore a bar). The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 60 nodes for these 15 points: about 50 Mithril Ore, 50 Solid Stone, 5 Gold Ore, 5 Dark Iron Ore and 5 Truesilver Ore. For Blacksmithing: about 385 Mithril Ore and 70 Solid Stone in all. For Engineering: about 165 Mithril Ore and 390 Solid Stone in all.
