# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Mining 245-275
section Mining 245-275

step Small Thorium (245-275)
  tip Walk the loop and mine every Gold (155, green, rare), Mithril (175, green), Dark Iron (230, orange, rare), Truesilver (230, orange), Small Thorium (245, orange) node on the way until Mining 275. Smelting gives no points from here (the higher smelts are grey once learned): smelt to craft or sell, or sell the ore. Dark Iron Ore smelts only at the Black Forge in Blackrock Depths (8 ore a bar). Quests in these zones need Mining: Salve via Mining (level 55, Arathandris Silversky, Felwood; Alliance), Salve via Mining (level 55, Maybess Riverbreeze, Felwood; Horde). The arrow takes the loop that gets you there soonest from where you are and walks it until the skill is reached; each loop keeps to creatures no more than a level above you and away from the other faction's towns, and the window names it and its lap. Expect about 40 nodes for these 30 points: about 25 Thorium Ore, 25 Dense Stone, 10 Mithril Ore and 10 Solid Stone. For Blacksmithing: about 1135 Thorium Ore, 25 Dense Stone, 385 Mithril Ore and 70 Solid Stone in all. For Engineering: about 175 Thorium Ore, 165 Mithril Ore and 390 Solid Stone in all.
